  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_7008.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Les xiques inspirades en la pel&middot;l&iacute;cula El Cigne Negre han guanyat la nit d&#39;aquest divendres el concurs de disfresses cin&egrave;files de les festes d&#39;estiu a Suera. El sopar es va fer al sal&oacute; de la Font Seca, en decissi&oacute; molt encertada de la Comissi&oacute; de Festes, ja que despr&eacute;s va diluviar. La vetlada es va tancar amb l&#39;actuaci&oacute; de La Kinki Band.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesdivendresfestesagostsuera/img_6974.jpg\" alt=\"img_6974\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesdivendresfestesagostsuera/img_6975.jpg\" alt=\"img_6975\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesdivendresfestesagostsuera/img_6976.jpg\" alt=\"img_6976\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesdivendresfestesagostsuera/img_6978.jpg\" alt=\"img_6978\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesdivendresfestesagostsuera/img_6979.jpg\" alt=\"img_6979\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesdivendresfestesagostsuera/img_6980.jpg\" alt=\"img_6980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesdivendresfestesagostsuera/img_6982.jpg\" alt=\"img_6982\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesdivendresfestesagostsuera/img_6983.jpg\" alt=\"img_6983\" style=\"ma